Task 21 — Workspace Selection & Management — Analysis and Implementation Plan

Goal

Replace the current single prototype-workspace flow with a simple MVP workspace selection flow.

Important: this task is currently ANALYSIS ONLY.
Do not modify production code, tests, migrations, frontend code, or documentation yet.

